## Why This Is Asked

Assesses ability to design multi-tenant residency, immutable regional logs, and global analytics under privacy rules.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant data residency, region-local stores, immutable logs
- Global analytics with privacy-preserving data contracts
- Cross-region replication, retention policies, and drift testing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Example TypeScript interface for data contract
interface TelemetryEvent {
  tenant_id: string;
  region: string;
  timestamp: string; // ISO
  event_type: string;
  payload: any;
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would you validate cross-region replication consistency at scale?
- How would you handle a tenant migrating regions mid-stream?

## Why This Is Asked
Gauges understanding of privacy-at-ingest, per-tenant residency, and practical, testable workflows for OTCA telemetry in mobile apps.

## Key Concepts
- Ingest-time policy evaluation
- Per-tenant residency and data partitioning
- Edge gateway to regional streaming
- Deterministic event ordering and testing

## Code Example
```javascript
function redactPayload(category, payload, policy){
  const out = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(payload));
  const cfg = policy[category] || {};
  if (cfg.redact) {
    for (const field of cfg.redact){ delete out[field]; }
  }
  return out;
}
```

